\b\fs24 Miku Voicebank 4.0\b0\fs18\par
\par
A joke program: it installs 51 blocks of "voicebank data", and uninstalling it\par
plays \i Hatsune Miku no Shoushitsu\i0  while printing the lyrics line by line.\par
\par
\b What this package does\b0\par
\par
\bullet  Copies the show into \f1 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\MikuVoicebank\f0 .\par
\bullet  Adds a Start menu shortcut (and a desktop one, if you leave that feature ticked).\par
\bullet  Registers itself under Settings > Apps > Installed apps.\par
\bullet  On uninstall, plays the show before removing anything.\par
\par
\b Everything is per-user.\b0  Nothing is written outside your own profile, and no\par
administrator rights are needed.\par
\par
\b Requirements\b0\par
\par
Node.js 18 or newer must already be installed - the show is a Node script.\par
\par
\b No audio is included\b0\par
\par
This package contains no music. On the first run the show downloads the song\par
to \f1 %LOCALAPPDATA%\\miku-voicebank\\cache\\\f0  from the address configured in\par
\f1 show.conf\f0 . If the download fails the lyrics still print, just silently.\par
\par
\b Copyright\b0\par
\par
\i Hatsune Miku no Shoushitsu\i0  is by cosMo@Bousou-P. The voice belongs to\par
Crypton Future Media. Buy the record; do not redistribute the audio.\par
\par
This is a toy for making videos with. Do not use it for anything serious.\par
